BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 441 Td (Cyclicity 1 \(always same unit digit\): 0, 1, 5, 6) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 424 Td (Cyclicity 2: 4 \(odd->4, even->6\) and 9 \(odd->9, even->1\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 407 Td (Cyclicity 4: 2, 3, 7, 8 -> Divide power by 4; if rem = 0, use power 4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 390 Td (Trailing zeroes in n! = floor\(n/5\) + floor\(n/25\) + floor\(n/125\) + ...) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 373 Td (Number of factors of N = p^a * q^b * r^c is \(a+1\)\(b+1\)\(c+1\).) Tj ET
