0.80 0.84 0.88 RG 0.8 w 48 343 m 547 343 l S
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 54 327 Td (Type 1 - Unit Digit: Find unit digit of 7^105.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 310 Td (105 mod 4 = 1 => unit digit = 7^1 = 7.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 54 293 Td (Type 2 - Remainder: Find remainder when 2^31 is divided by 5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 276 Td (2^2 = 4 = -1 \(mod 5\). 2^31 = \(2^2\)^15 * 2 = \(-1\)^15 * 2 = -2 = 3 \(mod 5\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 54 259 Td (Type 3 - Trailing Zeroes: How many zeroes at the end of 100! ?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 242 Td (floor\(100/5\) + floor\(100/25\) = 20 + 4 = 24 zeroes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 54 225 Td (Type 4 - Divisibility: Find x if 4x56 is divisible by 9.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 208 Td (4 + x + 5 + 6 = 15 + x => x = 3 \(since 18 is divisible by 9\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 54 191 Td (Type 5 - Bells/LCM: Bells ring at 6, 8, 12 sec intervals. Next ring together?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.20 0.25 0.33 rg 54 174 Td (LCM\(6, 8, 12\) = 24 seconds.) Tj ET
